#: ../../../user/how-to-guides/how-to-update.rst:73
#: 03a9f21a760b446f996fe99a6749617a
msgid ""
"After updating a template, first shut down the template, then restart all "
"running qubes based on that template. The updater will try to do this for "
"you automatically in the last step of updating. Remember to save all your "
