"If you use :doc:`Anti Evil Maid (AEM) </user/security-in-qubes/anti-evil-"
"maid>`, you’ll have to “reseal” after certain updates. It’s common for QSBs "
"to contain instructions to this effect. See the relevant QSB and the `AEM "
"README <https://github.com/QubesOS/qubes-antievilmaid/blob/main/README>`__ "
"for details."
msgstr ""

